{"format":1,"key":"zone:stockade","path":"/lore/zone/stockade","name":"The Stockade","kind":"dungeon","label":"Dungeon","zone":{"key":"stockade","name":"The Stockade","path":"/lore/zone/stockade"},"levels":"Levels 24-32","description":"The Stockade holds dangerous prisoners beneath Stormwind's canal district near the Mage Quarter. Built as a high-security prison for cutthroats…","intro":[],"clips":[{"id":"zone:stockade","part":"narration","anchor":"story","title":"The story","paras":["The Stockade holds dangerous prisoners beneath Stormwind's canal district near the Mage Quarter. Built as a high-security prison for cutthroats, political insurgents, and captured enemies of state, it has fallen into violent anarchy. Warden Thelwater is forced back to the entrance, seeking help to crush the riot before it reaches the capital.","Beneath Stormwind's canals, the Stockade has become a war zone. When the regular army marched to distant fronts, the understaffed prison relied on inexperienced youths, including fourteen-year-old recruits, to keep order. They failed. The inmates launched a bloody, coordinated rebellion, tore their wool blankets into gang scarves, and cut down the remaining guards. Warden Thelwater barely holds the entrance, while convicts control the cells, hallways, and holding blocks."],"hash":"17f666","voices":{"male-narrator":{"sha":"1cac928276","sec":50},"female-narrator":{"sha":"27412518e1","sec":50}}}],"sources":[{"kind":"wiki","title":"Stormwind Stockade (Classic)","url":"https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/Stormwind_Stockade_(Classic)"},{"kind":"wiki","title":"Stormwind Stockade","url":"https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/Stormwind_Stockade"}],"related":[{"p":"/lore/npc/warden-thelwater","n":"Warden Thelwater","k":"boss"},{"p":"/lore/npc/bruegal-ironknuckle","n":"Bruegal Ironknuckle","k":"boss"},{"p":"/lore/npc/kam-deepfury","n":"Kam Deepfury","k":"boss"},{"p":"/lore/npc/targorr-the-dread","n":"Targorr the Dread","k":"boss"},{"p":"/lore/npc/dextren-ward","n":"Dextren Ward","k":"boss"},{"p":"/lore/quest/391-the-stockade-riots","n":"The Stockade Riots","k":"quest"},{"p":"/lore/quest/389-bazil-thredd","n":"Bazil Thredd","k":"quest"},{"p":"/lore/npc/guard-berton","n":"Guard Berton","k":"npc"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/canals-stormwind-city","n":"Canals (Stormwind City)","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/stormwind-stockade","n":"Stormwind Stockade","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/stormwind-stockade-classic","n":"Stormwind Stockade (Classic)","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/npc/bazil-thredd","n":"Bazil Thredd","k":"boss"}],"children":[{"p":"/lore/npc/bazil-thredd","n":"Bazil Thredd","k":"boss"},{"p":"/lore/npc/bruegal-ironknuckle","n":"Bruegal Ironknuckle","k":"boss"},{"p":"/lore/npc/councilman-millstipe","n":"Councilman Millstipe","k":"boss"},{"p":"/lore/npc/dextren-ward","n":"Dextren Ward","k":"boss"},{"p":"/lore/npc/hamhock","n":"Hamhock","k":"boss"},{"p":"/lore/npc/kam-deepfury","n":"Kam Deepfury","k":"boss"},{"p":"/lore/npc/targorr-the-dread","n":"Targorr the Dread","k":"boss"},{"p":"/lore/npc/warden-thelwater","n":"Warden Thelwater","k":"boss"},{"p":"/lore/quest/377-crime-and-punishment","n":"Crime and Punishment","k":"quest"},{"p":"/lore/quest/387-quell-the-uprising","n":"Quell The Uprising","k":"quest"},{"p":"/lore/quest/388-the-color-of-blood","n":"The Color of Blood","k":"quest"},{"p":"/lore/quest/378-the-fury-runs-deep","n":"The Fury Runs Deep","k":"quest"},{"p":"/lore/quest/391-the-stockade-riots","n":"The Stockade Riots","k":"quest"},{"p":"/lore/quest/386-what-comes-around","n":"What Comes Around...","k":"quest"},{"p":"/lore/item/hand-of-dextren-ward","n":"Hand of Dextren Ward","k":"item"},{"p":"/lore/item/head-of-bazil-thredd","n":"Head of Bazil Thredd","k":"item"},{"p":"/lore/item/head-of-deepfury","n":"Head of Deepfury","k":"item"},{"p":"/lore/item/head-of-targorr","n":"Head of Targorr","k":"item"},{"p":"/lore/item/red-wool-bandana","n":"Red Wool Bandana","k":"item"}],"wowhead":"zone=717"}
